@dc:title "GNC Test Vehicle Bundle"
@dc:description "Closes the TV-1 description over the Apollo GNC method."
description bundle <http://example.com/gnc-test-vehicle/bundle#> as tv-bundle {
    uses <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/> as dc
    uses <http://www.example.com/apollo-cm-gnc/method/bundle#>
    includes <http://example.com/gnc-test-vehicle/description#>
}
